000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. KSDSNATL.
000300*    KSDSLOAD, written against native VSAM instead of VSAMIO.
000400*    Loads SVD001.VSTESTKS.CLUSTER from a sequential dataset and
000500*    must print exactly what the VSAMIO version prints.
000600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000700 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000800 FILE-CONTROL.
000900     SELECT RECORD-IMAGES ASSIGN TO DA-2314-S-IMAGES.
001000     SELECT KSDS-FILE ASSIGN TO KSDSF01
001100         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
001200         ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
001300         RECORD KEY IS KSDS-KEY
001400         FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
001500 DATA DIVISION.
001600 FILE SECTION.
001700 FD  RECORD-IMAGES
001800     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
001900     BLOCK CONTAINS 10 RECORDS.
002000 01  RECORD-IMAGE                PIC X(80).
002100 FD  KSDS-FILE
002200     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
002300     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
002400 01  KSDS-RECORD.
002500     02  KSDS-KEY                PIC X(10).
002600     02  FILLER                  PIC X(70).
002700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002800 01  WS-STATUS                   PIC X(2)  VALUE '00'.
002900 01  END-OF-FILE-SWITCH          PIC X(1)  VALUE 'N'.
003000     88  END-OF-FILE                       VALUE 'Y'.
003100 01  LOAD-FAILED-SWITCH          PIC X(1)  VALUE 'N'.
003200     88  LOAD-FAILED                       VALUE 'Y'.
003300 01  WRITE-FAILED-SWITCH         PIC X(1)  VALUE 'N'.
003400     88  WRITE-FAILED                      VALUE 'Y'.
003500 01  RECORD-COUNTER              PIC S9(8) VALUE +0.
003600 01  COUNTER-EDIT                PIC  ZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.
003700 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003800 000-INITIATE.
003900     DISPLAY 'KSDSLOAD: WRITE KSDS SEQUENTIALLY'.
004000     DISPLAY '---------------------------------'.
004100     DISPLAY ' '.
004200     OPEN INPUT RECORD-IMAGES.
004300     OPEN OUTPUT KSDS-FILE.
004400     IF WS-STATUS NOT = '00'
004500         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR DURING OPEN, STATUS ' WS-STATUS
004600         MOVE 'Y' TO LOAD-FAILED-SWITCH.
004700 010-PROCESS.
004800     PERFORM 110-PROCESS-DATA THRU 119-EXIT
004900         UNTIL END-OF-FILE OR LOAD-FAILED.
005000 020-TERMINATE.
005100     CLOSE RECORD-IMAGES.
005200     CLOSE KSDS-FILE.
005300     IF WS-STATUS NOT = '00'
005400         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR DURING CLOSE, STATUS ' WS-STATUS.
005500     MOVE RECORD-COUNTER TO COUNTER-EDIT.
005600     DISPLAY COUNTER-EDIT ' RECORDS WERE LOADED SUCCESSFULLY'.
005700     STOP RUN.
005800 110-PROCESS-DATA.
005900     READ RECORD-IMAGES
006000         AT END MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
006100     IF NOT END-OF-FILE
006200         PERFORM 120-ADD-RECORD THRU 129-EXIT.
006300 119-EXIT.
006400     EXIT.
006500 120-ADD-RECORD.
006600     MOVE RECORD-IMAGE TO KSDS-RECORD.
006700     MOVE 'N' TO WRITE-FAILED-SWITCH.
006800     WRITE KSDS-RECORD
006900         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO WRITE-FAILED-SWITCH.
007000     IF NOT WRITE-FAILED
007100         ADD +1 TO RECORD-COUNTER.
007200     IF WRITE-FAILED AND WS-STATUS = '24'
007300         DISPLAY 'INSUFFICIENT SPACE DEFINED IN CLUSTER TO '
007400                 'CONTAIN ALL RECORDS - LOADING TERMINATED'
007500         MOVE 'Y' TO LOAD-FAILED-SWITCH.
007600     IF WRITE-FAILED AND WS-STATUS = '21'
007700         DISPLAY 'KEY SEQUENCE ERROR DURING LOAD'
007800         DISPLAY 'RECORD BYPASSED: ' RECORD-IMAGE.
007900     IF WRITE-FAILED AND WS-STATUS NOT = '24'
008000                     AND WS-STATUS NOT = '21'
008100         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR DURING WRITE, STATUS ' WS-STATUS
008200         MOVE 'Y' TO LOAD-FAILED-SWITCH.
008300 129-EXIT.
008400     EXIT.
